<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SIKMA - Portal Walisantri</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="/images/logo-madrasah.webp">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css">
  <script src="/js/tailwind-config.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col">

  <!-- Navbar -->
  <header class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0 z-40">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex justify-between h-16 items-center">
        <a class="flex items-center gap-2" href="/">
          <div class="bg-brand-500 text-white p-2 rounded-lg shadow-md"><i class="bi bi-wallet2 text-lg"></i></div>
          <span class="font-bold text-xl tracking-tight text-brand-600">SIKMA</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/login" class="bg-brand-50 hover:bg-brand-100 text-brand-700 font-semibold px-4 py-2 rounded-full transition text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
          <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> Login Admin
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <main class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center py-12 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="max-w-3xl w-full text-center space-y-8">
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 tracking-tight">Selamat Datang di Portal Walisantri</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-500 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Sistem Informasi Keuangan Madrasah mempermudah Anda dalam memantau administrasi dan tagihan santri secara real-time.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Cek Tagihan Card -->
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-slate-100 max-w-xl mx-auto text-left relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-500 to-indigo-400"></div>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><i class="bi bi-search text-brand-500"></i> Cek Tagihan Santri</h2>
        
        <form action="/cek-tagihan" method="GET" class="space-y-5">
          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Lembaga Pendidikan</label>
            <select name="lembagaId" class="w-full rounded-xl border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 py-3 pl-4 pr-10 text-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:ring-brand-500 shadow-sm outline-none transition" required>
              <option value="">-- Pilih Lembaga --</option>
              <!-- Di dunia nyata, ini dilempar dari backend, tapi untuk sekarang kita hardcode atau load via AJAX -->
              <option value="1">Madrasah</option>
              <option value="2">PAUDQu</option>
              <option value="3">TPQ</option>
              <option value="4">MDT</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-2">Nama Santri Lengkap</label>
            <input type="text" name="namaSantri" placeholder="Contoh: Muhammad Farhan" class="w-full rounded-xl border-slate-300 bg-slate-50 py-3 px-4 text-sm focus:border-brand-500 focus:ring-brand-500 shadow-sm outline-none transition" required>
          </div>
          
          <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-700 text-white font-bold py-3.5 px-4 rounded-xl transition shadow-lg shadow-brand-500/30 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
            Cek Sekarang <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </button>
        </form>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-5 text-center">Fitur pencarian ini tidak memerlukan login. Pastikan penulisan nama santri sesuai dengan data madrasah.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="bg-white border-t border-slate-200 py-6 text-center">
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">&copy; 2026 SIKMA. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
